# Blog & vertical SEO content

## Blog posts (`src/data/blog.ts`)

- `slug`: lowercase kebab-case; include primary keyword when natural (`what-is-pay-per-call-marketing`)
- `title`: clear, specific, ≤ ~70 chars; year/guide framing OK when evergreen
- `excerpt`: 140–160 chars — doubles as meta description; include topic + RidgeRise relevance
- `tags`: 3–5 real phrases users search; reuse across related posts for internal themes
- `content`: length follows intent (no padding); first paragraph answers the title; last soft CTA (Discuss a Campaign / Become a Media Partner / related vertical)
- Position RidgeRise via in-house demand generation + performance network — not as a call broker or lead reseller
- Mention RidgeRise once or twice with a real differentiator; never invent results or volumes
- Clusters may span customer acquisition, performance marketing, media buying, Pay Per Call, inbound call generation — prioritize commercial relevance
- Link opportunities: related posts, `/buyers`, `/publishers`, matching `/verticals/{slug}`

```ts
// ✅ Excerpt usable as meta
excerpt:
  "Learn how pay-per-call works, why phone intent converts, and how publishers and buyers use RidgeRise Media to scale compliant call campaigns.",
```

## Verticals (`src/data/verticals.ts`)

- `name` + `summary` + `description` must each stand alone for SEO snippets
- `description`: what the call is, who buys, why intent is high — 1–2 sentences
- `buyerFit` / `publisherFit`: concrete roles (agencies, carriers, affiliates, media buyers)
- `keywords`: 2–4 high-intent phrases tied to that vertical only
- Detail page Seo title pattern: `{Name} Pay-Per-Call` (component appends brand)
- Keep category taxonomy stable: Insurance | Legal | Home Services | Finance | Other

## Blog / vertical pages

- Blog index may span the four SEO layers (acquisition, performance marketing, media buying, Pay Per Call) — avoid cannibalizing solution page primaries
- Only publish industry posts/pages for confirmed verticals; content must be genuinely vertical-specific
- Related reading / related verticals: same category or shared tags; never empty filler cards
- Article pages: pass `type="article"`, `publishedTime` from `post.date`, keywords from `post.tags`
